OL,3,CSecurity alert in Banbridge
OL,5,FA security alert is underway in
OL,6,FBanbridge.
OL,8,FPolice are at the scene in the Huntley
OL,9,FRoad area of the town on Saturday
OL,10,Fafternoon.
OL,12,FThe road is closed and diversions are
OL,13,Fin place at the Glassestown Road and
OL,14,FBallykeel Road.
OL,16,FRoad users and the public have been
OL,17,Fasked to avoid the area.
OL,19,FCatch up with the latest UTV Live on
OL,20,FITVX
